{"timestamp":"2026-08-05T21:06:46.060994+00:00","skill":"memory-branch-consolidation","action":"cherry-pick-episodic-two-ahead-onto-mcp-consolidation","result":"success","detail":"success","pain_score":4,"importance":8,"reflection":"OBSERVATION: Branch 2026-08-03-001-periscope-fts5-tag-lesson was ahead of its origin by exactly two commits (99557258 session summary; c8990a99 provenance-safe boundary). Neither was reachable from origin/main nor from consolidation tip 8e3df19f; both touched only .agent/memory/episodic/AGENT_LEARNINGS.jsonl. Cherry-pick onto 2026-08-05-001-mcp-consolidation-from-alphaclaw required JSONL union resolution (EOF divergence vs consolidation proactive-recall rows); resolved by appending unique run_ids only with byte-preserving lines (no full-file re-encode). Skipped pulling a6bf3ee9 lesson-mirror rows that were not part of the two-ahead delta. Branches not deleted. Unrelated open/local PT tips (post-grant-followup-pt, coderabbit-review-wave-sync, sync-attribution-guards, never-discard-work, etc.) intentionally excluded from this memory consolidation PR.\n\nINFERENCE: \"ahead by 2\" after a merged-PR lineage often means local episodic closeout not yet on the active consolidation branch â€” verify with merge-base/patch-id before assuming unmerged feature work.","confidence":0.95,"source":{"skill":"memory-branch-consolidation","profile":"default","run_id":"pid-81541","commit_sha":"176a759ab546c98e1b5fefb6ebd49c649260a0c4"},"evidence_ids":["pid-51220","pid-52468"]}
