{"timestamp": "2026-10-09T23:35:45.315839+00:00", "skill": "learn", "action": "manual-stage:4cf660e02f3d", "result": "success", "detail": "Manually staged lesson 4cf660e02f3d via .agent/tools/learn.py: 'Isolate concurrent inputs: each fan-out branch gets its own deep copy of the snapshot, and a join that admits no branch refuses the region like every other join; document that only events after the commit carry committed state.'", "pain_score": 1, "importance": 6, "reflection": "", "confidence": 0.9, "source": {"skill": "learn", "profile": "manual", "run_id": "manual_4cf660"}, "evidence_ids": ["2026-10-09T23:35:45.315839+00:00"]}
